{"title": "Weathers", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Wesley's Weathers</b> adds 5 new weathers that can occur on most moons: <span style=\"color: #B8860B;\"><b>Earthquakes</b></span>, <span style=\"color: red;\"><b>Forsaken</b></span>, <span style=\"color: purple;\"><b>Hallowed</b></span>, <span style=\"color:#0096C7;\"><b>Hurricane</b></span> and <span style=\"color: green;\"><b>Minefield</b></span>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Earthquakes\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Earthquakes\">&gt; Earthquakes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:EarthquakesWeather.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"EarthquakesWeather.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/EarthquakesWeather.png/250px-EarthquakesWeather.png?1f797d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/EarthquakesWeather.png/375px-EarthquakesWeather.png?1f797d 1.5x, /images/thumb/EarthquakesWeather.png/500px-EarthquakesWeather.png?1f797d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div>\n<p>Earthquakes weather causes an earthquake to occur roughly every 220 seconds upon loading a moon. This equates to a little over five hours of in-game time on a moon with a regular day speed, so an earthquake will occur around 01:00pm, 06:00pm, and 11:00pm.\n</p><p>On the exterior, this is purely auditory and visual. In the interior, this causes the roof to collapse and crush any player caught underneath the falling rubble. The amount of damage dealt varies and where the rubble falls is random. Some of this rubble gets left behind as an obstruction that disappears after about 45 seconds.\n</p><p>Earthquakes weather has a default scrap amount multiplier of 1.1, slightly increasing the total amount of scrap initially spawned on the moon.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Inside_.26_Outside_Ambience\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inside_&amp;_Outside_Ambience\">Inside &amp; Outside Ambience</span></h3>\n<p>During earthquake weather you can sometimes hear ambiences. One on the exterior and the other one within interior.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Outside_Ambience\">Outside Ambience</span></h4>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"38\" data-mwtitle=\"Earthquake_Outside.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Earthquake_Outside.mp3?43cd62\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Earthquake_Outside.mp3/Earthquake_Outside.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inside_Ambience\">Inside Ambience</span></h4>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"46\" data-mwtitle=\"Earthquake_Inside.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Earthquake_Inside.mp3?fc091a\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Earthquake_Inside.mp3/Earthquake_Inside.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Forsaken\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Forsaken\">&gt; Forsaken</span></h2>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ForsakenWeather.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"ForsakenWeather.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/ForsakenWeather.png/250px-ForsakenWeather.png?29ba40\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ForsakenWeather.png/375px-ForsakenWeather.png?29ba40 1.5x, /images/thumb/ForsakenWeather.png/500px-ForsakenWeather.png?29ba40 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div>\n<p>Forsaken weather plays ambient music and causes a storm of raining blood to occur on a moon. It also causes Emma, \"the forsaken child\", to haunt players. For example, Emma sometimes will fly towards a player in the interior while screaming. These encounters with Emma are purely auditory or visual and not to be confused with the entity Emma.\n</p><p>Forsaken weather causes <a href=\"/wiki/The_Wail\" title=\"The Wail\"><b>The Wail</b></a>, a variant of the Bracken with 10hp, to immediately spawn in the interior when landing. Additionally, the entity <a href=\"/wiki/Emma\" title=\"Emma\"><b>Emma</b></a>, which is a variant of the Ghost Girl, will spawn at exactly 02:00pm within the interior.\n</p><p>Forsaken weather has a default scrap amount multiplier and scrap value multiplier of 1.2, increasing the total amount of scrap initially spawned and the value of scrap on the moon.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Inside_.26_Outside_Ambience_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inside_&amp;_Outside_Ambience_2\">Inside &amp; Outside Ambience</span></h3>\n<p>During forsaken weather you can hear two ambiences: One plays on the exterior while the other one plays within interior.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Outside_Ambience_2\">Outside Ambience</span></h4>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"131\" data-mwtitle=\"ForsakenAmbienceOutside.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/ForsakenAmbienceOutside.mp3?5e952b\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/ForsakenAmbienceOutside.mp3/ForsakenAmbienceOutside.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inside_Ambience_2\">Inside Ambience</span></h4>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"131\" data-mwtitle=\"Forsaken_Ambience_Inside.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Forsaken_Ambience_Inside.mp3?934f89\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Forsaken_Ambience_Inside.mp3/Forsaken_Ambience_Inside.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Hallowed\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Hallowed\">&gt; Hallowed</span></h2>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:HallowedWeather.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"HallowedWeather.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/HallowedWeather.png/250px-HallowedWeather.png?65a60d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/HallowedWeather.png/375px-HallowedWeather.png?65a60d 1.5x, /images/thumb/HallowedWeather.png/500px-HallowedWeather.png?65a60d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div>\n<p>Hallowed weather plays ambient music and causes candles, which can float throughout the day, and pumpkins to spawn as objects on the exterior. If the Spooky Manor interior is generated, candles, pumpkins, and skulls will additionally decorate the interior.\n</p><p>Hallowed weather spawns map hazards on the exterior referred to as \"scrap head\". It is a pale head attached to a metal pole that lays dormant atop a mound of scrap metal. A player approaching the scrap head in its dormant state will cause it to activate, turn on its left eye which will emit a red light, lock onto the player, and begin to track the player's position for about 6-7 seconds. If the player walks into the red light during this time, the scrap head will attempt to lunge forward and bite the player, dealing 99 damage on contact, roar, and return to its dormant state. If the player is not detected, it will return to its dormant state. The scrap head has a cooldown of about 28 seconds before it can activate again once it returns to its dormant state.\n</p><p>Hallowed weather injects the <a href=\"/wiki/Arachnohead\" title=\"Arachnohead\"><b>Arachnohead</b></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Corpse_Crawler\" title=\"Corpse Crawler\"><b>Corpse Crawler</b></a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Creaker\" title=\"Creaker\"><b>Creaker</b></a> into the <b>Enemy Spawns (Interior)</b> table of any moon experiencing it with a weight of 35, 28, and 9 respectively. Any current weights less than these weights will be overridden.\n</p>\n<ul><li>The <b>Arachnohead</b> is a variant of the Bunker Spider with 2hp that explodes on death.</li>\n<li>The <b>Corpse Crawler</b> is a variant of the Spore Lizard that vomits out a <b>Gore Spike</b>, which acts as a hazard and pulses outward with spikes about every 8 seconds to deal 20 damage to nearby players.</li>\n<li>The <b>Creaker</b> is a variant of the Nutcracker with alternative sound effects and scrap. It exclusively spawns during this weather.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ambience\">Ambience</span></h3>\n<p>During Hallowed weather you can hear ambience that plays during this weather.\n</p><p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"63\" data-mwtitle=\"Halloween_Ambience.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Halloween_Ambience.mp3?7570d3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Halloween_Ambience.mp3/Halloween_Ambience.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Hurricane\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Hurricane\">&gt; Hurricane</span></h2>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:HurricaneWeather.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"HurricaneWeather.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/HurricaneWeather.png/250px-HurricaneWeather.png?dcdeb2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/HurricaneWeather.png/375px-HurricaneWeather.png?dcdeb2 1.5x, /images/thumb/HurricaneWeather.png/500px-HurricaneWeather.png?dcdeb2 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div>\n<p>Hurricane weather causes strong winds and heavy rain to occur on a moon. It also causes trees to fall from the sky on the exterior throughout the day, sometimes increasing in frequency and causing many trees to fall in quick succession. These trees will knock back the player if nearby and additionally deal 50 damage to the player if they are close to its impact. These trees will be left behind as obstructions for the rest of the day.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Scrap_Spawns\">Scrap Spawns</span></h3>\n<p>Hurricane weather typically spawns 8-9 scrap on the exterior immediately upon loading a moon, specifically around random outdoor AI nodes. It uses a separate Loot Table from the rest of the moon.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Loot Table\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bell</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bell.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Bell.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Bell.png/60px-Bell.png?da3e9c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Bell.png/90px-Bell.png?da3e9c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Bell.png/120px-Bell.png?da3e9c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>48</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>12.90%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Big bolt</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Big_bolt.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Big bolt.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/60px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/90px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Big_bolt.png/120px-Big_bolt.png?6206e2 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>12.90%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cash register</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cash_register.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Cash register.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Cash_register.png/60px-Cash_register.png?6d480e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Cash_register.png/90px-Cash_register.png?6d480e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Cash_register.png/120px-Cash_register.png?6d480e 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>84</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.65%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dust pan</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dust_pan.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dust pan.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Dust_pan.png/60px-Dust_pan.png?7ac97e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Dust_pan.png/90px-Dust_pan.png?7ac97e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Dust_pan.png/120px-Dust_pan.png?7ac97e 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>12.90%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Egg beater</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Egg_beater.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Egg beater.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Egg_beater.png/60px-Egg_beater.png?9924d1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Egg_beater.png/90px-Egg_beater.png?9924d1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Egg_beater.png/120px-Egg_beater.png?9924d1 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>44</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>5.16%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Large axle</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Large_axle.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Large axle.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Large_axle.png/60px-Large_axle.png?6b5c59\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Large_axle.png/90px-Large_axle.png?6b5c59 1.5x, /images/thumb/Large_axle.png/120px-Large_axle.png?6b5c59 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>9.68%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metal sheet</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Metal_sheet.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Metal sheet.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Metal_sheet.png/60px-Metal_sheet.png?567eb9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Metal_sheet.png/90px-Metal_sheet.png?567eb9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Metal_sheet.png/120px-Metal_sheet.png?567eb9 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>7.10%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tea kettle</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tea_kettle.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Tea kettle.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Tea_kettle.png/60px-Tea_kettle.png?e2b0f9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tea_kettle.png/90px-Tea_kettle.png?e2b0f9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Tea_kettle.png/120px-Tea_kettle.png?e2b0f9 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>44</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>10.32%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Steel ingot</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:(Ingredient)_Steel_ingot.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"(Ingredient) Steel ingot.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/%28Ingredient%29_Steel_ingot.png/60px-%28Ingredient%29_Steel_ingot.png?24c972\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/%28Ingredient%29_Steel_ingot.png/90px-%28Ingredient%29_Steel_ingot.png?24c972 1.5x, /images/thumb/%28Ingredient%29_Steel_ingot.png/120px-%28Ingredient%29_Steel_ingot.png?24c972 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>25.81%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V-type engine</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:V-type_engine.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"V-type engine.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/V-type_engine.png/60px-V-type_engine.png?801274\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/V-type_engine.png/90px-V-type_engine.png?801274 1.5x, /images/thumb/V-type_engine.png/120px-V-type_engine.png?801274 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>38</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2.58%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ambience_2\">Ambience</span></h3>\n<p>During hurricane weather you can hear ambience that plays outside.\n</p><p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"36\" data-mwtitle=\"Hurricane_Weather.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Hurricane_Weather.mp3?2278ab\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Hurricane_Weather.mp3/Hurricane_Weather.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Minefield\">Minefield</span></h2>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:MinefieldWeather.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"MinefieldWeather.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/MinefieldWeather.png/250px-MinefieldWeather.png?621921\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/MinefieldWeather.png/375px-MinefieldWeather.png?621921 1.5x, /images/thumb/MinefieldWeather.png/500px-MinefieldWeather.png?621921 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div>\n<p>Minefield weather causes several mines to immediately spawn on the exterior when landing. These mines will occassionally beep and will start beeping faster when a player is in close proximity to them. If a player stands too close to a mine for too long, it will explode. Players can safely trigger the mines without taking damage, but being too close to a mine will deal 30 damage to all nearby players or instantly kill all nearby players and most entities depending on the proximity to the blast. Giants will be lit on fire from an explosion.\n</p></div>", "images": ["EarthquakesWeather.png", "Earthquake_Outside.mp3", "Earthquake_Inside.mp3", "ForsakenWeather.png", "ForsakenAmbienceOutside.mp3", "Forsaken_Ambience_Inside.mp3", "HallowedWeather.png", "Halloween_Ambience.mp3", "HurricaneWeather.png", "Bell.png", "Big_bolt.png", "Cash_register.png", "Dust_pan.png", "Egg_beater.png", "Large_axle.png", "Metal_sheet.png", "Tea_kettle.png", "(Ingredient)_Steel_ingot.png", "V-type_engine.png", "Hurricane_Weather.mp3", "MinefieldWeather.png"], "cats": []}